 "description": "Listings similar to one property: same market (sale or rent), same\ntown, same kind of home, a similar number of bedrooms and a price\nwithin about 25%. Closest in price first. Use it for \"show me\nalternatives to PL12345\" or \"anything like this but cheaper?\".\n\nEvery property carries `oracle_verified` and\n`oracle_attestation_url`, as in search_properties.\n",
